    "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
    "english": "Chopsticks are an eating tool that began in China. You hold two thin sticks in one hand, pick up the food and carry it to your mouth. The history of chopsticks in China goes back several thousand years; the earliest were mostly made of bamboo or wood. Later they spread to neighbouring countries such as Japan and Korea. There are also polite customs: for example, you should never stand your chopsticks upright in a bowl of rice.",
